
# Pimbra patches - BEGIN

## Pimbra org
%GIT_OVERRIDES          = maldua-pimbra.url-prefix=https://github.com/maldua-pimbra

## zm-web-client
### Select Advanced Classic by default in login page.
### This avoids having submission errors when a logged-in user refreshes the page.
### ZBUG-4023:Upgraded jetty to 9.4.57.v20241219
%GIT_OVERRIDES          = zm-web-client.remote=maldua-pimbra
%GIT_OVERRIDES          = zm-web-client.tag=10.1.10.p3-maldua

## zm-nginx-conf
### Fix Chat Proxy vulnerability from 10.1.12.
%GIT_OVERRIDES          = zm-nginx-conf.remote=maldua-pimbra
%GIT_OVERRIDES          = zm-nginx-conf.tag=10.1.10.p2-maldua

## zm-build
### ZBUG-4023:Upgraded jetty to 9.4.57.v20241219
### This is applied directly in zm-build itself so not need to override its git repo

## zm-admin-console
### ZBUG-4023:Upgraded jetty to 9.4.57.v20241219
%GIT_OVERRIDES          = zm-admin-console.remote=maldua-pimbra
%GIT_OVERRIDES          = zm-admin-console.tag=10.1.10.p3-maldua

## zm-jetty-conf
### ZBUG-4023:Upgraded jetty to 9.4.57.v20241219
%GIT_OVERRIDES          = zm-jetty-conf.remote=maldua-pimbra
